-- ACTOR ----------------- errors/spawn_not_actor_4.march

`Bump` is a message of actor `Counter`, not an actor, so `spawn` cannot start it. [spawn_not_actor]
`spawn` takes the name of an `actor` declaration, like `spawn(Counter)`.

11 |     let p = spawn(Bump)
                       ^^^^

    run `march --explain spawn_not_actor`


